.com%2Fs%2F8RM8QWJfyWUjd0za4z5jYg\" target=\"_blank\">https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/8RM8QWJfyWUjd0za4z5jYg</a></div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\"></div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-6\" style=\"background: #FFF\">\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<center><img alt=\"官方消息135.jpg\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/2/27/3yedsvhbgb29bvkm8w6xnfsirjxbjyw.jpg/560px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF135.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"560\" height=\"90\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/2/27/3yedsvhbgb29bvkm8w6xnfsirjxbjyw.jpg 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"750\" data-file-height=\"120\" /></center>\n<div style=\"text-align: center; justify-content: center; margin: 15px 0%; display: flex; flex-flow: row nowrap; visibility: visible;\"><div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: top; width: auto; margin-right: -40px; flex: 10 10 0%; align-self: flex-start; height: auto; visibility: visible;\"><div style=\"margin-right: 0%; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0%; visibility: visible;\"><div style=\"border-top: 1px dashed rgb(158, 85, 31); visibility: visible;\"></div></div></div><div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: top; width: auto; flex: 10 10 0%; align-self: flex-start; height: auto; visibility: visible;\"><div style=\"margin-top: 10px; margin-right: 0%; margin-left: 0%; visibility: visible;\"><div style=\"border-top: 1px dashed rgb(158, 85, 31); visibility: visible;\"></div></div></div></div>\n<p>团长们好呀(oﾟ▽ﾟ)o  <br /><br />\n盛夏之夜，铃兰酒馆一片欢声笑语，期待着与各位团长把酒言欢。<br />\n为您送上铃兰小镇的7月日历。请团长查收~❤<br />\n</p>\n<div style=\"text-align: center; justify-content: center; margin: 15px 0%; display: flex; flex-flow: row nowrap; visibility: visible;\"><div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: top; width: auto; margin-right: -40px; flex: 10 10 0%; align-self: flex-start; height: auto; visibility: visible;\"><div style=\"margin-right: 0%; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0%; visibility: visible;\"><div style=\"border-top: 1